					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-3014.803,
							380.927,
							8549.981
						],
						"pointId": 8670
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-3014.679,
							380.789,
							8548.529
						],
						"pointId": 8671
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750110101,
					"content": "So this is the Upper Sanctum, huh... From down below, you'd think it was all gray and empty up here...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110102,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110103,
					"content": "Who'd have thought it would be like this...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110104,
					"content": "Indeed. It is said that the floating matter here is held together by the power of phlogiston, itself a highly vigorous energy source... It's a strange phenomenon, but that's the best way to understand it for now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110105,
					"content": "This also explains not only why grass and flowers grow above it, but also how it warms cooled earth anew, and ignites a conflagration of souls in the darkness.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110106,
					"content": "This is the phlogiston... Won for us by the Sage of the Stolen Flame, snatched from the very claws of the giant dragon.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110107,
					"content": "Hmph, and speaking of which, that reminds me... When some people in the tribe lay eyes upon the Upper Sanctum...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110108,
					"content": "...They have the nerve to doubt that a mere human could create such floating islands through the power of phlogiston, thus concluding that the Sage of the Stolen Flame must have been a kind of dragon too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110109,
					"content": "Rawr?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110110,
						750110111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110110,
					"content": "They actually believe that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110113,
					"content": "Just because they couldn't do it themselves, they insist that anyone who could must've been superhuman. I'd rather not hang around with people who have such a losing mentality.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110114,
					"content": "Uhh, anyway, what about the treasure and the elixir?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110115,
					"content": "Given that's what we've come for, it doesn't look like there's much for us here!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110116,
					"content": "Rawr...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110117,
					"content": "Hehe, you didn't actually think this was going to be that simple, did you? We're being put to the test by the \"mad\" Sage of the Stolen Flame, after all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110118,
					"content": "If the ancient scrolls are right, we must find some mechanisms to activate, complete the final trial, and then reach the center of the Upper Sanctum...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110119,
					"content": "But I have no more idea than you as to what this so-called center is supposed to look like. Thinking back, I'm sure the images of the floating islands I've seen before were a bit different from what we're seeing now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110120,
					"content": "But it's possible that as I've aged, even my memory — which I was once so proud of — is becoming unreliable. Anyway... seeing as we've come this far, let's rely on our intuition instead!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110121,
					"content": "So, how are we going to activate these mechanisms?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110122,
					"content": "Hmm... You should be able to activate them using phlogiston, just like with Phlogiston Engraving?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110123,
					"content": "That's what's shown in the scrolls, anyhow. Apparently, the Phlogiston Chiseliths all over Natlan were based on the mechanisms here... Making these mechanisms incredible relics in and of themselves.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110124,
					"content": "#Well, {M#lad}{F#lass}, you've shown great promise so far, hehe. Time you went and gave it a try, hmm?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110111,
					"content": "People are free to think what they want...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110112,
					"content": "I understand that changing the way other people think about the world can be nigh-on impossible, but why, if it doesn't drive me up a wall!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				}
			]
		},
