			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750110201,
					"content": "Whew, this should be the last mechanism...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110202,
					"content": "This one's no different from the others. Chikya, you sure you haven't fallen for some kind of trick?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110203,
					"content": "Rawr...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110204,
					"content": "Of course not! When it comes to deciphering ancient scrolls, I have great confidence... some confidence... well, a certain degree of confidence in my abilities!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110205,
					"content": "Your confidence is shrinking by the second! Gah, help!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110206,
					"content": "Anyway, I'm fairly sure this isn't the last mechanism. If I remember rightly, it should be larger and... more complete?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110207,
					"content": "\"Floating islands\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110208,
					"content": "#{M#Young lad}{F#Young lass}, irrespective of the great promise you've shown, no one will understand you unless you speak in full sentences.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110209,
					"content": "...As for whether the treasure is real, and the elixir really exists... Well, you'll only know once you've given it a try.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110210,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110211,
					"content": "If it doesn't work this time, it'll work the next; and if not here, then somewhere else. As long as you stay in the game, a miracle's bound to happen sooner or later!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110212,
						750110214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110212,
					"content": "Your optimism truly knows no bounds.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110213,
					"content": "I'll take that as a compliment!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110216,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110217,
					"content": "#Hehe, see, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}'s excited too. Come on then, {NICKNAME}, use phlogiston to activate the mechanism!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110214,
					"content": "If we can motivate ourselves to keep trying, that'll be a miracle in itself...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110215,
					"content": "We'll have none of that kind of negativity here!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				}
			]
		},
		{
