							8543.854
						],
						"pointId": 9099
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750110301,
					"content": "Well I never, a hidden island in the center of the Upper Sanctum... *sigh* And there I was, wondering why it looked so different from what I saw in the pictures.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110302,
					"content": "So my memory's fine after all. I wouldn't be in charge of looking after all those ancient woven scrolls if it wasn't, hmm?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110303,
					"content": "But apart from that even larger rock in the middle, there's nothing else here... Or could this giant rock itself be the Sage's legendary gift?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110304,
					"content": "Rawr?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110305,
					"content": "...At this point, I'm genuinely stumped. In all the scrolls I've seen, when the heroes pass the trial and reach this place, they should sense the spirit of the Sage of the Stolen Flame.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110306,
					"content": "As long as you've reached this place by passing the trial, you're supposed to feel as if you're being called, somehow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110307,
					"content": "But I've no idea what that means in practice. I was under the impression that I'd be able to work that out once I got here, that I could... *sigh* Looks like that was wishful thinking...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110308,
					"content": "Rawr... Rawr?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110309,
					"content": "#Huh... {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, are you seeing this?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110310
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110310,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110311,
					"content": "Then... Do you know what it means?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110312,
					"content": "Rawr...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110313,
					"content": "#You... saw something? You saw something!? Gracious me! So the one worthy of the gift was you after all, {M#young lad}{F#young lass}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110314,
					"content": "Huh? Paimon didn't see anything either... Weird.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110315,
					"content": "I saw a golden pattern...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110316
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110316,
					"content": "Rawr! Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110317,
					"content": "#A golden pattern? You mean, the same one you saw the first time you met {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110318,
					"content": "Wait, Paimon thought you were just seeing things back there!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110319,
					"content": "Rawr! Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110320,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, telling Paimon to look up's no use, she can't see it! But seeing as you've said it's there...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110321,
						750110322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110321,
					"content": "The tone sounds familiar too...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110323
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110323,
					"content": "So maybe the one that left it behind was the Sage of the Stolen Flame?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110324,
					"content": "What, what? You mean to say that you've previously been given a sign by the Sage of the Stolen Flame...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110325,
					"content": "#I said you had a bright future ahead of you, {M#lad}{F#lass}, and what lies before you now, but a future oh so radiant? I knew you showed great promise — I wouldn't have taken a shine to you otherwise! So, have you figured out how to receive the gift?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chikya"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110326,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110327,
						750110328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750110327,
					"content": "Yes, I just have to...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110329
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110329,
					"content": "The stone tablet starts to reverberate with a loud rumbling sound.\\nAs the earth trembles, the giant rock on the ground reveals its true form...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 750110328,
					"content": "(Reach out towards the giant stone tablet...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110329
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750110322,
					"content": "It's definitely the same person that left that golden pattern before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750110323
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7501105,
